# Comprehensive UI/UX Overhaul

The current application lacks a functional styling engine (Tailwind CSS) and suffers from poor spacing and legibility. This plan addresses these issues through a complete design refresh.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This overhaul includes installing new dependencies (`tailwindcss`, `postcss`, `autoprefixer`) and creating configuration files.

## Proposed Changes

### [Infrastructure]

#### [NEW] [tailwind.config.js](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/tailwind.config.js)
Define the Tailwind configuration with a custom "Celestial" color palette and typography.

#### [NEW] [postcss.config.js](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/postcss.config.js)
Standard PostCSS configuration for Vite.

