### [Layout & Components]

#### [MODIFY] [Layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/Layout.tsx)
- Improve sidebar spacing and typography.
- Enhance mobile navigation with better icons and active states.
- Ensure the main content area has generous padding.

#### [MODIFY] [Card.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/ui/Card.tsx)
- Update glassmorphism effects for a more premium look.
- Increase default padding for better ergonomics.

---

### [Plan & Pages]

#### [MODIFY] [PlannerPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/pages/planner/PlannerPage.tsx)
- Completly redesign the day cards.
